+    validate-state used repo_root, others already use root.
+ 2. Depth limit32 means at most 32 total records including active. R6 allowed
+    max31 for resolve walk (range32 needs terminator) and high walk. Fixed
+    agent range(LIMIT-1)->range(LIMIT) and high range32->range33. Low
+    _walk_chain_backwards already allows 32 via immediate None return and
+    derive len>32 allows 32, preserved. No numeric seq<=32 restriction (gaps
